  data: {
    LLM: '7 rounds with specific contracts: R1=2 trios (6 cards), R2=1 escalera+1 trio (7 cards), R3=2 escaleras (8 cards), R4=3 trios (9 cards), R5=2 trios+1 escalera (10 cards), R6=2 escaleras+1 trio (11 cards), R7=3 escaleras (12 cards). Turn: draw (from discard or draw pile), optionally meld, discard. To meld initially, must have complete contract and put it down at once. After initial meld, can add cards to any existing melds on table (extend trios with same rank, extend escaleras at either end). Cannot create new melds after initial contract. Ace can be high or low in escalera but not both. Jokers wild: max 1 per meld in initial contract, unlimited after. Joker at end of escalera can be moved by tucking in appropriate card. Round ends when player empties hand. Others score cards remaining.',
